        },
        {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "data": {
            "heading": "",
            "width": "narrow",
            "content": "<p>This policy explains how Highway Nomads collects and uses the personal information you share through this website.</p><h3>Information we collect</h3><p>Your name, phone number, email address, travel dates and preferences when you send an enquiry or book a trip. For bookings we also collect traveller names and, where needed, passport details.</p><h3>How we use it</h3><p>Only to plan and book your trip, and to share it with hotels, airlines and transport partners who need it to provide your services. We never sell your data.</p><h3>Your choices</h3><p>Write to us to correct or delete your information at any time.</p>"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "terms-and-conditions": {
